WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.336
A short appointment can overlap two different commitments You

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:07.836
have checked the authority and information conditions for accepting

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:11.757
work You will now apply planning to Daniel’s diary

00:00:12.113 --> 00:00:17.442
the supplier’s proposed 09:45–10:15 appointment overlaps both preparation and

00:00:17.494 --> 00:00:21.652
the service-investment decision meeting It is easy to spot

00:00:21.692 --> 00:00:23.902
that a diary is busy and still miss the

00:00:23.955 --> 00:00:27.928
exact loss of preparation We will put the requested

00:00:27.942 --> 00:00:31.376
supplier time beside the existing blocks and identify both

00:00:31.442 --> 00:00:33.665
conflicts before recommending a change
